This license applies to the Parlance runtime: the `editor/runtime/` directory
of the Parlance repository and the `@orbitope/parlance-runtime` package built
from it — the code that plays a Parlance narrative project (conditions,
effects, dialogue stepping, checks, offers, quests, progression, saves and the
project loader). It is granted under the same terms as the Parlance
specification (LICENSE-SPEC), which lists this directory among its paths, and
separately from the Parlance editor's own license: the runtime is meant to ship
inside games, including commercial ones.

